{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260lPYSlkaWb1793081051.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本駐俄羅斯大使館探視被俄方以涉嫌間諜罪拘留的《北海道新聞》記者。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RUS-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dGA78HztRQ1793081057.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>該名記者本月13日在俄羅斯遠東薩哈林州，被俄羅斯聯邦安全局拘留，目前被關押在莫斯科的看守所。日本外務省表示，日方駐俄大使館人員周一對事主進行領事探視，確認其健康無問題；又指強烈要求俄方立即放人，並提供人道主義關懷，以及公正、公平的對待。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RUS-1300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026iSYtT7Cies1793081054.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:51.327209+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T06:38:17.506932+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:58:31.406508+00:00","content_hash":"04c65cc76bf94a4dca626bdd260a73383b58f03daf5c8b4c15bbefb61ae12f55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:01:51.327209+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}